WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.760
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:54.640 --> 01:55.760
Orchid.

02:08.720 --> 02:09.560
My lord!

02:10.800 --> 02:12.840
Didn't you drink Fairy Orchid's
Dream of Nine Serenities?

02:13.920 --> 02:14.960
Why are you still in pain?

02:22.880 --> 02:24.560
Since we are to be husband and wife,

02:26.360 --> 02:28.400
we must stay together
until death do us part

02:29.440 --> 02:30.760
for better or for worse.

02:35.200 --> 02:36.640
Even though

02:37.600 --> 02:39.800
I cannot bear this trial for her,

02:41.840 --> 02:45.880
how can I let her suffer alone?

02:49.240 --> 02:50.080
My lord.

02:51.720 --> 02:52.600
My lord!

03:18.920 --> 03:19.840
My lord.

03:21.120 --> 03:22.000
My lord.

03:42.160 --> 03:43.040
Where is she?

03:43.120 --> 03:44.280
Where is the Fairy Tribe woman?

03:47.960 --> 03:49.000
Come out!

03:49.080 --> 03:49.960
Come out now!

03:52.080 --> 03:52.920
Let her out!

03:53.400 --> 03:54.640
Lord Xunfeng,

03:55.320 --> 03:56.640
unless the tortured person

03:57.120 --> 03:58.360
voluntarily gives up,

03:59.200 --> 04:01.000
the punishment cannot be stopped.

04:03.840 --> 04:04.800
Give up!

04:05.360 --> 04:06.520
You can't hold on anymore.

04:06.600 --> 04:07.480
Come out now!

04:08.520 --> 04:09.440
Answer me!

04:11.880 --> 04:13.520
She doesn't have the strength to speak.

04:13.600 --> 04:14.760
Open the sarcophagus now!

04:14.840 --> 04:16.320
Fairy Orchid.

04:16.880 --> 04:17.800
I'll count to ten.

04:19.000 --> 04:20.120
If you aren't giving up,

04:20.640 --> 04:22.200
knock twice on the sarcophagus.

04:23.960 --> 04:24.840
One.

04:25.760 --> 04:26.720
Two.

05:22.240 --> 05:23.320
- It's so pretty.
- It's so beautiful.

05:26.840 --> 05:28.080
What are you doing?

05:41.440 --> 05:42.280
Three.

05:43.240 --> 05:44.120
Four.

05:44.600 --> 05:45.840
Five.

05:46.600 --> 05:47.520
Six.

05:48.240 --> 05:49.080
Seven.

05:49.960 --> 05:50.840
Eight.

05:51.600 --> 05:52.440
Nine.

05:54.600 --> 05:56.640
Look, it's Cloud-Whale.

06:29.800 --> 06:30.720
My lord.

06:32.320 --> 06:33.200
My lord.

06:42.840 --> 06:43.680
My lord.

06:45.680 --> 06:46.520
Get up.

07:41.960 --> 07:44.120
The three-day sentence is up.

07:44.200 --> 07:45.160
Open the sarcophagus.

07:54.640 --> 07:56.760
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

09:32.000 --> 09:34.000
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

09:35.200 --> 09:37.240
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

09:38.080 --> 09:40.240
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

09:41.240 --> 09:43.240
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

09:44.200 --> 09:46.240
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

09:46.320 --> 09:48.440
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

09:48.520 --> 09:50.760
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

09:51.720 --> 09:53.640
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

09:54.880 --> 09:56.840
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

09:58.160 --> 10:00.200
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

10:01.600 --> 10:03.520
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

10:17.120 --> 10:18.880
My lord, as Shuiyuntian's God of War,

10:18.960 --> 10:20.360
the immortal criminal, Changheng,

10:20.440 --> 10:21.560
has disregarded his duties,

10:21.640 --> 10:22.760
violated heavenly laws,

10:22.840 --> 10:24.080
broken marriage engagement,

10:24.160 --> 10:25.280
and communicated with a spy

10:25.360 --> 10:26.800
yet refuses to admit his guilt.

10:26.880 --> 10:28.600
The law will not tolerate this.

10:28.680 --> 10:29.840
He should be immediately sent

10:29.920 --> 10:31.760
to Immortal Slaying Pavilion
for execution.

10:40.040 --> 10:40.960
Wait.

10:48.120 --> 10:51.680
After all, Changheng is the son
of our father, Lord Dong.

10:52.480 --> 10:53.720
Before execution,

10:54.520 --> 10:55.840
all must be accounted for.

11:04.160 --> 11:05.600
From this moment on,

11:06.640 --> 11:09.200
Changheng is stripped of his immortal rank

11:09.280 --> 11:10.520
and deposed.

11:11.360 --> 11:13.920
You are no longer
the son of our father, Lord Dong.

11:14.560 --> 11:17.360
You will have no clan, no surname,

11:18.000 --> 11:20.240
and will not be worshipped after death

11:21.200 --> 11:22.640
or included in the Heavenly Tablet.

11:23.160 --> 11:24.960
Your name will be removed forever

11:25.040 --> 11:27.960
from the genealogy
of Shuiyuntian's immortals,

11:28.520 --> 11:30.000
just like your deserter mother.

11:40.080 --> 11:41.320
All fault lies with me!

11:42.520 --> 11:43.760
Lord Changheng is innocent.

11:44.360 --> 11:46.000
Danyin, step down!

11:46.080 --> 11:48.920
Orchid is the Goddess of Xishan
who has been missing for 30,000 years.

12:17.200 --> 12:18.640
The Xilan Holy Seal.

12:19.760 --> 12:20.960
It purifies evil qi.

12:22.480 --> 12:23.760
She is indeed the goddess.

12:28.280 --> 12:29.560
In order to save Orchid,

12:30.640 --> 12:32.640
Lord Changheng
repeatedly visited the Cangyan Sea.

12:33.200 --> 12:34.600
It was not in defiance of the rules

12:34.680 --> 12:35.760
or for a love affair.

12:36.720 --> 12:39.720
It was because of the destined marriage.

12:47.120 --> 12:48.160
I knew long ago

12:48.240 --> 12:50.360
that Orchid is the Goddess of Xishan.

12:51.360 --> 12:52.360
I once saw

12:52.440 --> 12:54.160
the scenes of two weddings

12:54.240 --> 12:55.880
between Lord Changheng and Orchid

12:55.960 --> 12:57.400
in the Tianji Mirror at Arbiter Hall.

12:58.520 --> 13:00.240
One was the tribulation
in the Mortal World.

13:00.960 --> 13:03.920
The other was when Lord Changheng
and the Goddess of Xishan

13:06.360 --> 13:09.400
were surrounded and blessed
by all from the Fairy Realm

13:11.960 --> 13:13.600
at their wedding by the Oblivion River.

13:21.880 --> 13:23.920
The Tianji Mirror reveals the future.

13:25.040 --> 13:26.360
It never makes a mistake.

13:28.200 --> 13:30.200
Orchid is the Goddess of Xishan.

13:36.600 --> 13:38.360
Why did you wait until now to reveal this?

13:39.720 --> 13:40.640
I am

13:43.360 --> 13:45.200
in love with Lord Changheng.

13:47.640 --> 13:49.520
I didn't want him to find the goddess

13:50.400 --> 13:51.440
and fulfill the engagement.

13:52.120 --> 13:53.480
So I kept this a secret.

13:55.920 --> 13:57.240
I was selfish.

13:59.040 --> 14:00.280
I disregarded the big picture.

14:02.240 --> 14:03.920
I chased after my selfish desires,

14:05.080 --> 14:06.560
which led to a big mistake.

14:08.520 --> 14:09.520
Please, my lord.

14:11.040 --> 14:12.720
Spare Lord Changheng.

14:15.600 --> 14:17.240
The one to go to Immortal Slaying Pavilion

14:19.720 --> 14:20.640
should be me.

14:26.560 --> 14:28.080
Danyin, get up.

14:29.160 --> 14:30.160
Lord Changheng.

14:32.120 --> 14:33.280
I'm sorry.

14:33.360 --> 14:34.520
You did nothing wrong.

14:38.760 --> 14:40.800
What Changheng said is correct.

14:40.880 --> 14:43.960
Fairy Danyin has found the goddess.

14:44.440 --> 14:46.240
She has made up for her mistake.

14:46.320 --> 14:49.920
The Goddess of Xishan has been
defending the three realms for generations

14:50.000 --> 14:51.600
against the Evil God Taisui.

14:53.480 --> 14:55.920
Changheng risked his life many times

14:56.000 --> 14:57.920
to save the goddess.

14:58.000 --> 14:59.360
It was a righteous act.

15:03.200 --> 15:04.600
Heavenly law and fate

15:05.400 --> 15:07.320
are indeed unfathomable.

15:09.440 --> 15:10.920
Changheng is not guilty.

15:11.640 --> 15:14.200
He should return
to his position as God of War.

15:15.200 --> 15:17.200
Lord Changheng,

15:17.280 --> 15:19.080
welcome back
to the position of God of War.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.400
My lord,

15:25.480 --> 15:26.800
this is the confession

15:26.880 --> 15:28.680
written by imprisoned criminal Ronghao.

16:01.760 --> 16:03.000
According to Ronghao,

16:03.720 --> 16:06.880
the Moon Tribe has rampantly
invaded our borders

16:07.640 --> 16:11.200
and slaughtered
3,000 of our heavenly soldiers.

16:15.240 --> 16:16.640
If this is not avenged,

16:17.640 --> 16:21.320
how can the soldiers' souls rest in peace?

16:22.480 --> 16:25.160
Please send troops to the Cangyan Sea

16:25.680 --> 16:27.080
to avenge our tribesmen.

16:28.040 --> 16:29.840
- Avenge our tribesmen!
- Avenge our tribesmen!

16:30.400 --> 16:32.440
- Avenge our tribesmen!
- Avenge our tribesmen!

16:41.160 --> 16:42.040
Ronghao.

16:42.120 --> 16:43.320
Why did you lie?

16:43.400 --> 16:44.760
You're here.

16:44.840 --> 16:46.160
Why did you blame the Moon Tribe

16:46.240 --> 16:47.760
for the 3,000 soldiers' deaths

16:47.840 --> 16:49.160
and start a war?

16:49.240 --> 16:51.400
There is only plain tea in the prison.

16:51.880 --> 16:53.200
Do you want to drink with me?

16:53.280 --> 16:54.320
Answer me!

17:01.160 --> 17:03.000
You already know the answer.

17:03.080 --> 17:04.720
Why do you need to ask me?

17:08.480 --> 17:10.880
Does it really matter to your brother

17:11.880 --> 17:14.359
why 3,000 heavenly soldiers
were slaughtered?

17:15.319 --> 17:16.800
I merely offered him

17:16.880 --> 17:18.880
a reason that he wanted.

17:29.360 --> 17:32.280
It wouldn't do him any good

17:32.360 --> 17:34.760
to execute a lay immortal like me.

17:35.880 --> 17:37.240
However,

17:37.320 --> 17:39.880
if it were Dongfang Qingcang
who killed 3,000 heavenly soldiers,

17:40.360 --> 17:41.920
he could unite Shuiyuntian

17:42.640 --> 17:45.080
under this excuse to dispatch troops.

17:45.680 --> 17:48.400
Your brother can then send troops

17:48.480 --> 17:49.760
to the Cangyan Sea

17:50.320 --> 17:51.840
and raze it to the ground.

17:53.800 --> 17:55.360
I won't let him get his way.

17:57.480 --> 17:58.520
The Moon Tribe has suffered

17:59.320 --> 18:00.440
from years of civil war.

18:00.960 --> 18:01.920
Their army is weak.

18:02.840 --> 18:04.680
But Dongfang Qingcang is very powerful.

18:05.280 --> 18:06.520
He can manipulate Hellfire.

18:07.160 --> 18:09.120
His power alone
can defeat an army of 10,000.

18:09.600 --> 18:10.680
So if you,

18:11.160 --> 18:12.840
the God of War, don't join the war,

18:13.320 --> 18:14.520
your brother

18:15.600 --> 18:17.520
absolutely will not act rashly.

18:18.240 --> 18:19.160
Isn't that so?

18:19.680 --> 18:20.880
What's your point?

18:21.400 --> 18:22.400
Dongfang Qingcang

18:23.640 --> 18:25.520
can no longer command Hellfire.

18:25.600 --> 18:26.480
What?

18:28.880 --> 18:30.320
That day at the Oblivion River,

18:30.400 --> 18:31.680
he was only momentarily injured.

18:32.480 --> 18:34.200
How can he be unable to command Hellfire?

18:34.280 --> 18:36.000
So whether you want to or not,

18:37.120 --> 18:38.240
this war

18:38.800 --> 18:39.640
will happen.

18:43.280 --> 18:44.560
And you

18:45.160 --> 18:46.360
will definitely join in.

18:49.640 --> 18:51.000
And you're destined to fight.

18:52.640 --> 18:54.200
Because we are both the same.

18:54.680 --> 18:55.880
I have no choice.

18:56.680 --> 18:58.520
In the end, you have no choice either.

18:58.600 --> 18:59.880
You have no choice?

19:00.920 --> 19:03.600
You chose to conspire with my brother
to incite chaos

19:03.680 --> 19:06.120
and instigate the biggest war
in the three realms in millennia!

19:15.880 --> 19:16.720
Ronghao.

19:18.680 --> 19:20.200
If you still think of me as a friend,

19:22.320 --> 19:24.240
tell me what you are hiding.

19:25.160 --> 19:26.200
Is everything you've done

19:27.440 --> 19:29.360
truly just to resurrect
the former God of War?

19:31.920 --> 19:34.200
Smart people never get good endings.

19:36.840 --> 19:37.720
Changheng,

19:38.720 --> 19:40.120
I can lie to the whole world.

19:41.240 --> 19:42.400
But I will never lie to you.

19:44.360 --> 19:45.440
It might be good for you

19:46.400 --> 19:47.920
not to know the reason.

20:01.640 --> 20:03.480
- Jieli.
- I have things to do.

20:03.560 --> 20:04.800
Why do you keep following me?

20:04.880 --> 20:06.240
Then why do you keep avoiding me?

20:06.800 --> 20:07.760
I'm not.

20:07.840 --> 20:08.960
Yes, you are.

20:09.040 --> 20:10.160
Lately, whenever I find you,

20:10.240 --> 20:11.640
you're either busy or going to bed.

20:12.320 --> 20:14.120
We don't talk for long when we meet.

20:14.640 --> 20:17.080
I feel that we're growing apart.

20:20.560 --> 20:22.080
I really do have something to do.

20:23.400 --> 20:25.520
I have to look
at wedding dress materials for Orchid.

20:25.600 --> 20:27.080
- I can't be late.
- Hold on.

20:27.160 --> 20:28.200
Jieli.

20:28.280 --> 20:30.360
I have to tell you
something very important.

20:40.880 --> 20:41.960
What is this?

20:42.040 --> 20:43.640
This is the key to my cellar.

20:43.720 --> 20:45.880
All my savings over the years
are in there.

20:45.960 --> 20:47.120
And my future salary too.

20:48.000 --> 20:49.120
It's all yours.

20:52.480 --> 20:53.520
What's wrong with you?

20:53.600 --> 20:54.480
Take it back.

20:55.600 --> 20:56.560
Hear me out.

20:57.880 --> 20:59.000
I know

20:59.080 --> 21:00.160
I have very little money.

21:00.760 --> 21:02.000
It might not be to your liking.

21:02.840 --> 21:04.440
But today, I want you to understand

21:05.160 --> 21:06.960
that I want to give you everything I have.

21:07.680 --> 21:10.120
I want to give you
all the good things in this world.

21:13.360 --> 21:14.360
Because I want

21:16.200 --> 21:17.520
to marry you, Jieli.

21:22.320 --> 21:23.400
Don't feel awkward.

21:24.960 --> 21:27.040
I know I may not reach your standards.

21:27.600 --> 21:30.640
But after telling you
everything I want to say,

21:31.200 --> 21:32.200
I feel much better.

21:38.720 --> 21:39.760
Your meager salary

21:39.840 --> 21:41.400
isn't even enough to buy a nice house.

21:43.840 --> 21:44.880
That's true.

21:45.960 --> 21:46.960
But my lord has said it.

21:48.880 --> 21:50.280
He's going to increase my salary.

21:51.640 --> 21:52.560
On your salary,

21:52.640 --> 21:54.360
you'll never be able
to afford a bride-dowry.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.600
How can you marry me?

22:00.120 --> 22:00.960
You're right.

22:03.880 --> 22:04.760
So

22:05.320 --> 22:06.440
after we get married,

22:07.160 --> 22:08.200
I'll run a business.

22:08.880 --> 22:11.600
You'll be in charge of inventory,
running errands, helping out,

22:11.680 --> 22:13.400
and soliciting business.

22:14.240 --> 22:17.680
And I won't give you a cut anymore.

22:17.760 --> 22:19.560
All profits will go to me.

22:19.640 --> 22:21.280
Stupid Black Dragon, do you hear me?

22:22.200 --> 22:23.160
"After we get married?"

22:24.040 --> 22:24.880
Jieli.

22:26.440 --> 22:27.760
Do you agree to marry me?

22:28.320 --> 22:29.240
What else could I mean?

22:31.280 --> 22:32.880
- Be gentler.
- This is great!

22:32.960 --> 22:35.400
- You've agreed to marry me!
- Put me down, Stupid Black Dragon!

22:36.600 --> 22:37.600
I'm getting dizzy!

22:47.000 --> 22:47.960
The big war is coming.

22:48.760 --> 22:50.280
You've been preparing all night.

22:50.760 --> 22:52.000
You must be exhausted.

22:56.080 --> 22:56.960
It's you.

22:57.520 --> 22:59.160
You once promised

22:59.240 --> 23:01.880
to repay my lord for saving your family.

23:02.640 --> 23:04.160
Now that my lord is in trouble,

23:04.240 --> 23:08.080
it's time for you to fulfill your promise.

23:08.160 --> 23:10.440
I did make a promise.

23:10.520 --> 23:13.560
But it was made
to the lay immortal Ronghao,

23:13.640 --> 23:14.880
not the Lord of Haishi.

23:16.400 --> 23:18.480
Not only do I refuse to help the evildoer,

23:19.120 --> 23:21.560
but I shall also capture you,
a remnant of the evil of Haishi.

23:35.200 --> 23:37.280
I had destroyed that with my own hands.

23:38.600 --> 23:40.200
How did it end up in your hands?

23:44.800 --> 23:46.000
Could it be…

23:47.720 --> 23:49.680
Neither the Fairy Tribe nor the Moon Tribe

23:49.760 --> 23:50.840
will tolerate them.

23:51.680 --> 23:52.840
Our only option now

23:52.920 --> 23:54.840
is to make one fully a fairy

23:55.480 --> 23:56.720
and assimilate the other

23:56.800 --> 23:57.880
into the Moon Tribe.

24:17.680 --> 24:18.840
Ever since that night,

24:20.520 --> 24:21.920
I've been searching for Xingluo.

24:22.880 --> 24:24.640
But I never heard back from her.

24:26.920 --> 24:28.000
It was you people.

24:29.520 --> 24:32.120
It was you people who hid Xingluo
and my other daughter.

24:33.000 --> 24:35.800
Your wife was weakened from childbirth.

24:36.280 --> 24:38.400
She died as she was fleeing.

24:38.480 --> 24:41.120
It was my lord
who took the child away and raised her.

24:42.600 --> 24:44.760
Now that you have
the whereabouts of your daughter,

24:45.360 --> 24:46.640
you should be happy.

24:49.080 --> 24:50.000
You…

24:51.640 --> 24:54.000
You've lied to me for so many years.

25:16.040 --> 25:18.080
What does he want me to do?

25:18.160 --> 25:20.240
This task should not be difficult for you.

25:21.320 --> 25:23.720
Get my lord out of Karma Jail.

25:30.280 --> 25:31.400
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

25:34.200 --> 25:35.160
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

25:39.320 --> 25:40.520
- Greetings, Moon Queen.
- Greetings, Moon Queen.

25:44.640 --> 25:46.000
Get up first.

25:49.760 --> 25:50.680
Shangque.

25:53.960 --> 25:54.920
Greetings, Moon Queen.

25:55.920 --> 25:58.000
Shangque, why are you doing this too?

25:59.000 --> 26:00.360
Get up.

26:01.480 --> 26:03.760
Shangque, get up now.

26:03.840 --> 26:04.800
Do you hear me?

26:07.320 --> 26:08.160
Get up.

26:08.240 --> 26:09.120
Yes, Moon Queen.

26:12.120 --> 26:13.240
And them too.

26:14.080 --> 26:15.080
You may all go.

26:19.840 --> 26:20.920
Fairy Orchid.

26:21.760 --> 26:23.040
Have you seen Jieli?

26:24.240 --> 26:25.440
She just went out.

26:27.600 --> 26:29.720
All right.
Then get some rest, Fairy Orchid.

26:32.400 --> 26:33.240
Hold on.

26:40.680 --> 26:41.880
Do you have the feeling

26:42.440 --> 26:44.360
that Jieli has been acting strange lately?

26:47.160 --> 26:48.840
Now that you mention it,

26:48.920 --> 26:49.840
I think…

26:52.240 --> 26:53.800
She treated me to sugar cakes yesterday

26:53.880 --> 26:55.280
and paid for it.

26:55.360 --> 26:56.240
There's more.

26:56.320 --> 26:58.000
On the Mountain and Moon Festival,

26:58.080 --> 27:00.000
she gave me
50% of the spirit stones she earned.

27:03.600 --> 27:05.360
So it wasn't my imagination.

27:07.640 --> 27:08.680
Look.

27:08.760 --> 27:10.840
This is the dowry she gifted me.

27:10.920 --> 27:12.600
For nothing. Free.

27:12.680 --> 27:13.720
And she said

27:13.800 --> 27:15.720
that I'm free of all my previous debts.

27:16.280 --> 27:17.200
That's so nice of her.

27:18.960 --> 27:19.800
Fairy Orchid,

27:19.880 --> 27:22.040
do you know what the strangest thing is?

27:24.640 --> 27:25.480
It is

27:26.200 --> 27:27.760
that I asked her to marry me

27:27.840 --> 27:28.760
and she said yes.

27:30.160 --> 27:31.760
But she didn't ask for a bride-dowry.

27:33.520 --> 27:35.200
- Really?
- Yes.

27:38.840 --> 27:41.920
Shangque, do you think Jieli is possessed?

27:42.480 --> 27:43.840
Possessed?

27:43.920 --> 27:44.960
No evil thing dares

27:45.040 --> 27:46.320
to cause trouble

27:46.400 --> 27:48.040
with my lord here in Silent Moon Palace.

27:49.880 --> 27:50.760
You're right.

27:56.840 --> 27:57.720
I get it.

27:58.440 --> 27:59.680
Jieli grew up alone

27:59.760 --> 28:02.160
and had to work hard to survive in Haishi.

28:02.240 --> 28:03.480
She had no one to turn to.

28:03.560 --> 28:04.920
She has suffered so much.

28:05.440 --> 28:07.960
Only a lot of money
can bring her a sense of security.

28:08.680 --> 28:09.840
So in the past,

28:09.920 --> 28:12.240
she had to fuss over every bit of money.

28:12.960 --> 28:14.480
But things are different now.

28:14.960 --> 28:16.480
She has someone she loves

28:16.560 --> 28:18.080
and a good friend like me.

28:18.720 --> 28:19.680
From now on,

28:19.760 --> 28:21.480
Silent Moon Palace will be her home.

28:22.040 --> 28:23.480
Now that her situation is different,

28:23.560 --> 28:24.760
her frame of mind is different.

28:24.840 --> 28:26.360
Naturally, she will change.

28:28.200 --> 28:29.040
Then…

28:29.800 --> 28:32.120
I must treat her better than ever.

28:32.200 --> 28:33.560
Of course.

28:33.640 --> 28:35.040
If you dare to treat Jieli badly,

28:35.120 --> 28:36.480
I'll be the first to hunt you down.

28:37.360 --> 28:38.240
I won't.

28:41.160 --> 28:42.680
Look at the hairpin that Jieli gave me.

28:43.320 --> 28:44.240
Isn't it beautiful?

28:45.920 --> 28:47.000
It is.

28:57.320 --> 28:58.240
Lord Xunfeng.

28:59.120 --> 29:00.160
How are you?

29:08.200 --> 29:09.400
How dare you come here?

29:09.880 --> 29:11.400
Don't you want to know

29:11.480 --> 29:14.320
why the Moon Supreme's Hellfire
still hasn't recovered?

29:21.440 --> 29:23.800
Fairy Orchid,
my lord invites you to a banquet.

29:23.880 --> 29:24.960
It is almost time.

29:58.840 --> 30:00.400
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

30:05.120 --> 30:06.040
Orchid.

30:08.200 --> 30:09.400
My husband, there you are.

30:23.720 --> 30:24.800
What's the matter with you?

30:25.880 --> 30:26.880
My dear.

30:28.600 --> 30:30.800
You have kept me waiting.

30:39.080 --> 30:40.200
You are not Orchid.

30:41.000 --> 30:42.000
Who are you?

30:43.960 --> 30:45.280
Moon Supreme,

30:45.360 --> 30:46.800
I have an important matter to report.

30:47.360 --> 30:49.560
Lord Xunfeng,
my lord doesn't want to see you.

30:53.640 --> 30:54.520
Greetings, my lord.

30:55.200 --> 30:56.200
Greetings, Moon Queen.

30:56.280 --> 30:57.520
Why?

30:59.200 --> 31:02.400
Why are you always interrupting us?

31:25.000 --> 31:26.000
My lord.

31:26.880 --> 31:28.160
How did this happen?

31:28.720 --> 31:31.200
The Bone Orchid was made
from my heart's blood.

31:32.360 --> 31:34.280
If she is not deeply in love with me,

31:34.840 --> 31:37.200
the Bone Orchid is just
an ordinary protective artifact.

31:37.760 --> 31:38.720
However,

31:39.520 --> 31:40.880
if she is devoted to me,

31:41.920 --> 31:43.840
the Bone Orchid
will not be able to be taken off.

31:44.400 --> 31:45.360
Taking it by force

31:45.440 --> 31:46.800
would cause her mortal harm.

31:49.960 --> 31:52.440
So she is already deeply in love with you.

31:56.440 --> 31:57.800
Lady Chidi's spirit still exists

31:58.280 --> 31:59.720
and is in the Bone Orchid?

32:00.560 --> 32:01.600
Moon Supreme,

32:01.680 --> 32:04.440
we could bring back the 100,000 soldiers
in the Xuanxu Realm.

32:05.720 --> 32:08.120
But why haven't you
taken off the Bone Orchid?

32:08.200 --> 32:10.520
Do you think I don't want to?

32:14.680 --> 32:17.240
The fragmented spirit of Lady Chidi

32:17.320 --> 32:20.200
is using the Bone Orchid
to feed on her spiritual power.

32:20.680 --> 32:22.320
If I don't take it off,

32:22.400 --> 32:23.760
in less than ten days,

32:23.840 --> 32:26.720
when Lady Chidi's spirit is restored,

32:28.640 --> 32:30.400
she will die of exhaustion.

32:35.760 --> 32:37.080
Does this mean

32:38.760 --> 32:40.160
that Moon Queen won't live long?

32:42.520 --> 32:44.240
If her life is not preserved,

32:45.360 --> 32:46.920
then my lord's life will also…

32:47.440 --> 32:48.400
Moon Supreme,

32:49.520 --> 32:50.480
I have a solution.

32:51.120 --> 32:53.080
We've found
the last fragment of the Chengying Sword.

32:54.640 --> 32:56.560
The Chengying Sword has been recast.

32:57.200 --> 32:58.040
How can it be?

32:59.000 --> 33:00.680
The Moon Queen loves you deeply.

33:00.760 --> 33:02.600
She would kill herself
with the Chengying Sword

33:02.680 --> 33:04.040
to save your life.

33:04.120 --> 33:05.360
Give me the Chengying Sword.

33:13.720 --> 33:15.440
Do you want to destroy it?

33:17.080 --> 33:18.160
Hand it over.

33:20.440 --> 33:21.560
I cannot do it.

33:22.040 --> 33:23.920
You are the Moon Tribe's last hope.

33:26.120 --> 33:28.520
Your life must not be compromised.

33:28.600 --> 33:29.600
Hand it over!

33:29.680 --> 33:30.520
Moon Supreme!

33:36.000 --> 33:38.040
Only by obtaining Lady Chidi's spirit

33:38.760 --> 33:41.160
can we save
the 100,000 soldiers in Xuanxu Realm.

33:41.640 --> 33:43.720
We've already failed once.

33:43.800 --> 33:45.520
We can't fail a second time!

33:47.480 --> 33:49.080
Today, a spy reported

33:49.960 --> 33:52.160
that Shuiyuntian
has already raised their troops

33:52.240 --> 33:54.000
and is ready to start a full-scale war.

33:55.720 --> 33:57.680
If the 100,000 soldiers can't return,

33:58.640 --> 34:01.720
the Moon Tribe will face annihilation,
Moon Supreme!

34:13.080 --> 34:15.320
If I could protect you by dying,

34:16.560 --> 34:18.760
I would not hesitate to do so.

34:19.239 --> 34:21.280
After Moon Queen joins our tribe,

34:21.360 --> 34:23.320
she should have
a greater sense of self-sacrifice!

34:23.400 --> 34:24.679
That's what I call a worthy death!

34:24.760 --> 34:25.639
Shut up!

34:26.480 --> 34:28.159
I will never sacrifice her!

34:31.400 --> 34:33.159
I will think of another way.

34:35.840 --> 34:36.679
No wonder.

34:37.159 --> 34:39.360
No wonder Father was resolved to die
to rid you of emotions!

34:39.440 --> 34:40.880
Watch your words, Lord Xunfeng.

34:41.440 --> 34:42.920
If I had known this would happen,

34:43.480 --> 34:45.960
I would have died by your Hellfire Sword

34:47.040 --> 34:48.920
rather than see you
become a good-for-nothing

34:49.000 --> 34:50.280
who has the wrong priorities!

34:51.040 --> 34:52.080
Lord Xunfeng!

34:57.720 --> 34:58.880
Dongfang Qingcang.

35:00.240 --> 35:02.720
Take your time
thinking about your strategy here.

35:04.120 --> 35:05.560
I will leave.

35:09.720 --> 35:10.600
I almost forgot.

35:12.360 --> 35:14.080
I've already found out

35:14.160 --> 35:15.320
that you cultivated Hellfire

35:15.400 --> 35:16.960
by ridding yourself of emotions.

35:17.440 --> 35:18.960
Now that you're engrossed in love

35:19.040 --> 35:20.240
and your emotions returned,

35:20.920 --> 35:22.560
the Hellfire has naturally disappeared.

35:23.520 --> 35:24.840
As you are now,

35:27.120 --> 35:29.280
you're no longer
the supreme one admired and worshipped

35:30.080 --> 35:32.040
by all in the three realms.

35:40.880 --> 35:41.760
My lord.

35:42.920 --> 35:44.560
Lord Xunfeng was just being impulsive.

35:45.240 --> 35:46.720
He only said that about the Hellfire

35:47.440 --> 35:48.440
in the heat of the moment.

35:51.920 --> 35:53.360
I had already guessed it.

35:55.320 --> 35:56.880
I just didn't want to face it.

36:06.160 --> 36:07.840
I dare not imagine

36:09.560 --> 36:10.840
how I can protect

36:12.840 --> 36:16.000
the people of the Cangyan Sea or her

36:19.400 --> 36:20.840
without Hellfire.

36:28.040 --> 36:29.160
Stupid Black Dragon.

36:29.240 --> 36:30.400
Why isn't he here yet?

36:31.040 --> 36:31.880
He's so slow.

36:40.840 --> 36:41.880
Greetings, Pavilion Master.

36:41.960 --> 36:43.080
Where is the goddess?

36:43.160 --> 36:44.760
What you don't know is that

36:44.840 --> 36:46.680
Qingcang has recently assigned more guards

36:46.760 --> 36:47.800
to protect Orchid.

36:47.880 --> 36:49.280
I'm afraid that acting rashly

36:49.360 --> 36:50.840
would expose me

36:50.920 --> 36:52.160
and spoil my lord's plan.

36:52.240 --> 36:54.920
That's enough.
You've repeatedly come up with excuses.

36:55.000 --> 36:57.840
You must've forgotten the effects
of the Heart-Eroding Pill's poison.

37:10.480 --> 37:12.360
Pavilion Master, please spare my life.

37:13.680 --> 37:15.360
If you bring the goddess out,

37:16.040 --> 37:17.640
I'll completely cure you of the poison.

37:36.080 --> 37:37.440
You would rather die?

37:38.880 --> 37:40.880
You two sure are close.

37:41.440 --> 37:42.560
But I am curious.

37:43.400 --> 37:44.960
If you had to choose one person,

37:45.880 --> 37:47.360
would you choose your friend

37:48.120 --> 37:49.480
or your man?

37:51.520 --> 37:52.720
What did you do to Shangque?

37:53.640 --> 37:54.600
Where is he?

37:56.640 --> 37:58.720
He was just poisoned
by my Butterfly-Scale Poison.

38:01.400 --> 38:02.640
Jieli.

38:03.360 --> 38:04.440
Jieli.

38:04.520 --> 38:05.720
Why are you here?

38:07.720 --> 38:10.560
I'll give you three days' worth
of the Heart-Eroding Pill's antidote.

38:10.640 --> 38:11.880
After three days,

38:11.960 --> 38:14.080
if you haven't brought the goddess out,

38:14.160 --> 38:15.400
you and your man

38:16.360 --> 38:17.960
will succumb to the poison together.

38:18.040 --> 38:18.880
Moreover,

38:19.880 --> 38:22.000
he will die more painfully than you.

38:45.400 --> 38:46.240
Jieli.

38:46.320 --> 38:47.280
Jieli.

38:48.240 --> 38:49.120
Jieli.

38:49.200 --> 38:51.360
Where have you been?
What took you so long?

38:51.440 --> 38:52.400
I'm sorry.

38:52.480 --> 38:53.560
It wasn't on purpose.

38:53.640 --> 38:54.640
I just--

39:05.920 --> 39:07.400
Why did you pull on my collar?

39:08.880 --> 39:11.280
A mole on the shoulder
means poverty for life.

39:12.920 --> 39:15.000
I was checking your luck with wealth.

39:15.080 --> 39:16.840
That's nonsense.

39:21.200 --> 39:22.080
What's wrong with you?

39:22.920 --> 39:24.080
Why are your eyes red?

39:25.440 --> 39:26.880
It's all because of you.

39:26.960 --> 39:28.160
You took so long to get here.

39:28.240 --> 39:30.120
Sand got into my eyes.

39:30.200 --> 39:31.480
I'm sorry.

39:31.560 --> 39:32.440
On the way here,

39:32.520 --> 39:34.760
I saw a crispy candy shop.

39:34.840 --> 39:36.640
I wanted to buy some for you.

39:36.720 --> 39:39.080
But the candy wasn't ready yet.

39:39.160 --> 39:40.800
So I waited there for a while.

39:40.880 --> 39:42.160
Let me tell you.

39:42.240 --> 39:44.120
This candy must be eaten while it's hot.

39:48.560 --> 39:49.800
Why is it all crushed to pieces?

39:51.640 --> 39:52.800
It's fine.

39:53.480 --> 39:54.720
It still tastes the same.

39:58.280 --> 39:59.480
It's still sweet.

40:04.560 --> 40:05.680
What's the matter?

40:06.440 --> 40:07.680
It's nothing.

40:07.760 --> 40:08.840
I just feel that

40:09.920 --> 40:11.640
although I held it carefully in my arms

40:12.120 --> 40:13.360
and protected it,

40:13.440 --> 40:14.520
it was still crushed.

40:17.000 --> 40:18.480
It doesn't seem like a good sign.

40:18.560 --> 40:20.480
You said I was talking nonsense,

40:20.560 --> 40:22.400
but you're the one
with a wild imagination.

40:23.920 --> 40:25.680
Maybe my imagination is running wild.

40:26.640 --> 40:28.640
But I really hope

40:28.720 --> 40:29.760
that my lord, Fairy Orchid,

40:30.320 --> 40:31.400
you, and I

40:31.480 --> 40:32.560
can all be well

40:32.640 --> 40:34.360
and have everything go smoothly.

40:35.840 --> 40:36.880
What's wrong with Orchid?

40:40.240 --> 40:41.320
Nothing.

40:42.040 --> 40:43.040
Stupid Black Dragon,

40:43.120 --> 40:44.480
you don't know how to lie.

40:44.560 --> 40:46.520
You've been preoccupied
for the past few days.

40:46.600 --> 40:48.760
You even feared a bad sign.

40:49.840 --> 40:51.200
I want to hear the truth.

40:52.520 --> 40:55.080
Jieli, I really can't tell you.

40:55.160 --> 40:56.200
Don't ask.

40:56.760 --> 40:58.040
After you agreed to marry me,

40:58.120 --> 41:00.200
I was so happy that I couldn't sleep.

41:00.280 --> 41:01.840
But lately, I don't know what it is.

41:02.680 --> 41:04.480
I keep feeling a tightness in my chest.

41:05.640 --> 41:09.400
Maybe this all feels too blissful.

41:09.480 --> 41:10.680
It doesn't seem real.

41:11.240 --> 41:12.360
What are you talking about?

41:12.920 --> 41:14.280
Stupid Black Dragon,

41:14.360 --> 41:15.720
are you having regrets?

41:15.800 --> 41:18.040
Do you think I'm a miser or a spendthrift?

41:18.120 --> 41:19.240
How can that be?

41:21.520 --> 41:23.480
Maybe it's the unstable situation lately.

41:25.240 --> 41:26.760
War could start at any moment.

41:26.840 --> 41:28.480
I fear that if I don't make it back,

41:28.560 --> 41:29.840
I won't be able to protect you.

41:29.920 --> 41:30.840
Take it back!

41:30.920 --> 41:32.200
What are you talking about?

41:33.440 --> 41:34.760
Stupid Black Dragon,

41:34.840 --> 41:35.880
I'm telling you.

41:35.960 --> 41:37.640
You must live peacefully to old age.

41:37.720 --> 41:38.960
Nothing can happen to you.

41:39.640 --> 41:40.520
Do you hear me?

41:41.400 --> 41:42.440
Promise me.

42:09.240 --> 42:10.840
I'll keep you safe.

42:14.720 --> 42:15.800
For the past 30,000 years,

42:15.880 --> 42:17.200
the Moon Tribe has been disunited

42:17.280 --> 42:18.320
and leaderless.

42:18.960 --> 42:20.200
That is why Shuiyuntian was able

42:20.280 --> 42:21.880
to seize our territories.

42:21.960 --> 42:23.880
Now that my lord has returned,

42:24.640 --> 42:26.000
the Moon Tribe is once again united

42:26.560 --> 42:27.920
and of one mind.

42:28.000 --> 42:29.040
This is the time

42:29.120 --> 42:30.480
for us to take revenge

42:30.560 --> 42:32.760
and crush the Fairy Realm!

42:32.840 --> 42:34.720
- Take revenge!
- Take revenge!

42:34.800 --> 42:36.520
- Crush the Fairy Realm!
- Crush the Fairy Realm!

42:36.600 --> 42:38.200
- Take revenge!
- Take revenge!

42:38.280 --> 42:40.080
- Crush the Fairy Realm!
- Crush the Fairy Realm!

42:43.400 --> 42:45.680
But the previous plan
to free the 100,000 soldiers

42:45.760 --> 42:46.640
has failed.

42:47.600 --> 42:48.560
Now we face

42:48.640 --> 42:50.440
an army of 200,000 menacing fairies.

42:51.320 --> 42:52.720
We are outnumbered.

42:53.280 --> 42:54.880
I'm afraid our outlook is bleak.

42:56.280 --> 42:57.360
In my opinion,

42:57.840 --> 42:59.000
we should give up Silver Lake

42:59.080 --> 43:00.400
and retreat to Ninth You.

43:02.360 --> 43:04.480
What do you think, Moon Supreme?

43:15.840 --> 43:17.800
Lord Xunfeng, what are you talking about?

43:17.880 --> 43:19.240
Do you want to cede more land?

43:19.320 --> 43:20.600
In the past 30,000 years,

43:20.680 --> 43:22.640
haven't we lost enough territory?

43:22.720 --> 43:24.440
The lord has returned now.

43:24.520 --> 43:26.160
Although we don't have enough troops,

43:26.240 --> 43:28.120
each of our warriors is brave enough

43:28.200 --> 43:29.160
to be worth ten.

43:29.240 --> 43:30.360
Besides,

43:30.960 --> 43:32.200
we still have the lord.

43:32.280 --> 43:33.400
That's right.

43:33.480 --> 43:34.320
The lord's Hellfire

43:34.400 --> 43:36.200
can take out an army of 10,000 on its own.

43:36.280 --> 43:38.720
We might not lose this battle!

43:38.800 --> 43:40.160
But what if we lose?

43:40.240 --> 43:41.400
The people of the Moon Tribe

43:41.480 --> 43:43.440
are not cowards!

43:43.520 --> 43:44.840
If we lose,

43:44.920 --> 43:47.240
we will willingly follow the lord

43:47.320 --> 43:48.560
and die on the battlefield!

43:48.640 --> 43:50.280
- Kill the enemy!
- Kill the enemy!

43:50.360 --> 43:51.960
- Wipe out our shame!
- Wipe out our shame!

43:52.040 --> 43:53.600
- Kill the enemy!
- Kill the enemy!

43:53.680 --> 43:55.360
- Wipe out our shame!
- Wipe out our shame!

43:55.440 --> 43:57.080
- Kill the enemy!
- Kill the enemy!

43:57.160 --> 43:58.840
- Wipe out our shame!
- Wipe out our shame!

43:58.920 --> 44:00.400
- Kill the enemy!
- Kill the enemy!

44:00.480 --> 44:02.120
- Wipe out our shame!
- Wipe out our shame!

44:02.200 --> 44:03.720
- Kill the enemy!
- Kill the enemy!

44:03.800 --> 44:05.480
- Wipe out our shame!
- Wipe out our shame!
